# STIG RHEL-09-271040: RHEL 9 must not allow unattended or automatic logon via the 
# STIG ID: V-258018 (HIGH)

META
    esp_id `r9-rhel-09-271040-gdm-no-autologin-001`
    version `1.0.0`
    dsl_schema_version `1.0.0`
    platform `rocky9`
    criticality `critical`

    title `STIG RHEL-09-271040: RHEL 9 must not allow unattended or automatic logon via the graphical user inter`
    description `RHEL 9 must not allow unattended or automatic logon via the graphical user interface.`
    author `example-security`
    tags `rhel9,stig,disa-stig`

    control_mapping `DISA-STIG:RHEL-09-271040,NIST-800-53:CM-6`
    control_objective `CM-6`

    assessment_method `TEST`
    implementation_status `implemented`
    responsible_role `system-admin`

    control_origination `sp-system`
    inherited_from `Rocky9:localhost:os-hardening`
    customer_responsibility `configuration`

    remediation_days `1`
    recommendation `Review and remediate per DISA STIG guidance for RHEL-09-271040.`

    component_id `comp-r9-os`

    impl_CM_6 `This control is validated by checking the required system configuration against the DISA STIG baseline for RHEL 9.`

META_END

DEF
    OBJECT target_file
        path `/etc/gdm/custom.conf`
    OBJECT_END

    STATE content_check
        content string contains `AutomaticLoginEnable=false`
    STATE_END

    CRI AND
        CTN file_content
            TEST all all AND
            STATE_REF content_check
            OBJECT_REF target_file
        CTN_END
    CRI_END
DEF_END
